.TH TJT 1
.SH NAME
tjt \\- sample transient processes and deleted executables
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tjt
tjt [--duration DURATION] [--interval DURATION]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Samples short-lived processes and records deleted executable path evidence where visible.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBtjt --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
